invariant: INV-11
file: srv_flight.c
catches: webpki_loop_aes
reason: the server hashes its CertificateVerify into the SHA-256
  transcript whatever suite it selected. In a TLS_AES_256_GCM_SHA384
  session the SHA-384 transcript, which every later read takes, then
  lacks that message, and the client's Finished fails to verify
  (docs/decisions.md 146).

--- old
    TRANSCRIPT_UPDATE_SELECTED_CPU(h->t->cfg.cpu, &h->t->transcript, sel->hash_len, msg, n);
--- new
    TRANSCRIPT_UPDATE_SELECTED_CPU(h->t->cfg.cpu, &h->t->transcript, SHA256_LEN, msg, n);
